h  in essentials and special in essentials  shops opened to selling things nobody  could possibly need but were encouraged  by advertising and social  competitiveness to won't generally chat  in one form or another the tap shops are  closed for now we are discovering what  we can easily do without and it is  liberating the world which we assumed  would only become more prosperous has  gone poverty will strike many who with  good reason never dreamed that they  would be affected by it  the phrase wake-up call has become much  used lately also with good reason they  don't make things like they used too  often just means they make things  differently which is true of films but  now I need the joy of the familiar and  thanks to streaming services such as  Netflix I can watch them in a click if  you don't already know these favorites  of mine do try  I just know you will love them Ocean's  eleven best heist flick whip-smart  dialog perfect casting George Clooney  The Magnificent Seven the Western to end  all some like it hot Marilyn Monroe's  Tony Curtis Jack Lemmon what more could  life hold where Eagles dare  Second World War remote Alpine resort  ski lift dramas funny Nazis Clint  Eastwood Richard Burton oh joy  isolation reading has been slow and  quick the Transylvanian trilogy by me  Klaus Banfi is a satisfyingly long  emotion into the aristocratic world  pre-1914 of the declining  austro-hungarian Empire quick reads are  Oxford's a very short introduction to  series I have just read a very short  introduction to medieval Britain  forensic psychology the Habsburg Empire  homer and criminology  I'm steadily filling the many holes in  my education and that was Susan Hill  thanks for listening and as ever  descending your thoughts are at podcast  at spectator doctor at UK join us again  next week  try four weeks of The Spectator  absolutely free and for this month only  you'll receive a spectator Wireless  phone charger go to WWE taco UK forward  slash charger forward